Repository: https://github.com/rogerluft/fazai-ng
Version: 3.21.0
Stack: TypeScript/Node.js (npm run build → tsc)

## SPEC COMPLETO — ESTADO ATUAL v3.21.0

### Entry Points
- CLI: bin/fazai → src/app.ts (main orchestrator)
- Web UI: src/web/ (Express, 4 pages: dashboard, ask, research, settings)
- MCP Server: src/mcp/server.ts (Model Context Protocol)
- Daemon: fazai-daemon.service (systemd, watchdog)

### Architecture: ECOA (Evolução Cognitiva via Arrays Autoinformativos)
- ResilienceOrchestrator: src/orchestrator/resilience-orchestrator.ts (multi-provider failover)
- ResearchCoordinator: src/research.ts (RAG-first research chain)
- TaskRouter: src/orchestrator/task-router.ts (intent classification → routing)
- Linux Executor: src/linux-executor.ts + src/linux-admin.ts (safe command execution)

### AI Providers (fallback chain in fazai.conf PROVIDER_FALLBACK_ORDER)
- Anthropic: Claude Opus 4.6 (primary) — native fetch, no SDK, no curl
- Google: Gemini via Cloudflare Worker proxy
- Ollama: local models (Qwen 3.5 primary offline, Phi-3 fallback) at 192.168.0.101
- OpenRouter: aggregator (includes MiniMax M2.5 as backup)
- Perplexity: web-augmented research
- OpenAI: GPT models
- Llama: local llama.cpp server

### Memory & RAG (Qdrant + ONNX local embeddings)
- Vector DB: Qdrant (6 collections, 768d BGE-base-en-v1.5 via ONNX)
- Collections: fazai_personality, fazai_memory, fazai_learning, fazai_kb, fazai_inference, fazai_semantic_cache
- Embedding: src/services/universal-embedder.ts (ONNX local, no API calls)
- Semantic Cache: src/services/semantic-cache.ts (threshold 0.6)
- Memory Loader: src/services/memory-loader.ts (500 entries max)
- Source Indexer: src/services/source-indexer.ts (codebase indexing)

### Research Chain (ordered)
1. RAG Local (Qdrant semantic search)
2. Perplexity (web-augmented)
3. Context7 (library docs via MCP)
4. Brave Search (web)
5. DuckDuckGo (fallback)
6. Web Crawler: src/research/web-crawler.ts (Playwright + stealth mode via CRAWLER_STEALTH flag)

### Security (5 layers — DO NOT TOUCH)
- Risk Classification: CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW
- Dry-run mode (preview before execute)
- Rollback capability
- Maestro Cleaner (GenAIScript: genaisrc/cleaner.genai.mjs)
- Watchdog: src/services/watchdog.ts

### Agentic Loop (CURRENT — to be evolved)
- AGENTIC_MAX_ITERATIONS=5 (fazai.conf)
- AGENTIC_TIMEOUT=120000ms
- ReAct-style but limited iterations

### GenAIScript (genaisrc/)
- cleaner.genai.mjs (Maestro Cleaner)
- fazai-core.genai.mjs (core prompts)
- reflect.genai.mjs (self-reflection)
- qa-reporter.genai.mjs (quality assurance)
- qdrant-adapter.genai.mjs (vector ops)
- completion-sync.genai.mjs
- model-migration-test.genai.mjs

### Orchestrator Clients
- Jules (Google): src/orchestrator/jules-client.ts + jules-api-client.ts
- Copilot: src/orchestrator/copilot-client.ts
- Gemini: src/orchestrator/gemini-client.ts
- Qdrant ops: qdrant-backup.ts, qdrant-container.ts, qdrant-metrics.ts, qdrant-import-export.ts

### Services Layer
- anthropic-auth.ts (multi-method auth, native fetch)
- cached-embedding-service.ts (embedding with cache layer)
- skill-seeker.ts (skill discovery)
- personality-loader.ts + personality-ingestor.ts
- api-cache.ts, api-status-checker.ts

### Config
- Central: /etc/fazai/fazai.conf (ALL config here, nowhere else)
- Schema validation: src/config/schema.ts (Zod)
- Timeouts: src/config/timeouts.ts (fetchWithTimeout)

### Tests
- 546 passing, 12 skipped
- Framework: Vitest
- Location: tests/unit/, tests/utils/

