## MISSION: Evolve FazAI-NG to next-gen autonomous agent

Goals (4 phases, agents collaborate holistically):

### PHASE 1 — Budget-Based Agent Loop + Heartbeat
- Evolve current loop from fixed 5 iterations to budget-based: configurable max_iterations + token_budget + circuit_breaker
- NOT infinite — "run until complete, fail, or exhaust budget"
- Add heartbeat every 30s (log + Qdrant status update)
- Session persistence (save state in fazai_memory + semantic_cache)
- Commands: /pause, /resume, /status, /kill
- Integrate Maestro Cleaner in loop
- RESPECT existing ResilienceOrchestrator — extend, don't replace

### PHASE 2 — Intelligent Context Assembly (the 10x multiplier)
- Before EVERY LLM call, auto-build rich context from existing collections:
  - Personalidade (from fazai_personality)
  - Regras de Segurança (from fazai_inference)
  - Contexto Relevante (RAG top-5 chunks threshold 0.65 from all 6 collections)
  - Histórico Recente (from fazai_memory)
  - Tarefa Atual
- Create src/context/context-assembler.ts — hook into the loop
- USE existing universal-embedder.ts and semantic-cache.ts — don't recreate

### PHASE 3 — Mature Skill/Tool Registry
- Centralized registry (src/skills/registry.ts)
- Each skill: id, name, description, JSON schema, handler, permissionLevel, category
- Auto-discovery from genaisrc/ (already has 7+ scripts)
- Commands: /skills, /use <skill>
- Dynamic runtime registration
- EXTEND existing skill-seeker.ts

### PHASE 4 — Gateway-ready (multi-input normalization)
- Normalize inputs (terminal CLI, web UI, webhook, future Telegram)
- Abstract input/output layer for future channels
- Keep existing web UI working as-is

## RULES FOR ALL AGENTS
- Analyze and propose — execution decided by Roger per task
- Preserve ALL 5 security layers untouched
- Use GenAIScript where possible for prompts
- Keep everything TypeScript, clean, modular
- Extend existing components (ResilienceOrchestrator, ResearchCoordinator, universal-embedder) — don't replace
- Config goes in fazai.conf — no new config files
- Tests must pass (546+ current baseline)

## OUTPUT FORMAT
1. Complete spec of proposed changes (files to create/modify)
2. Architecture diagrams (text-based) showing integration with existing components
3. Detailed implementation plan per phase with dependencies
4. Risk assessment (what could break, how to mitigate)
5. Suggested execution order and who should code each part
6. Test plan for each phase

Start the mission. Coordinator, assign agents and begin analysis.

